1.4    Organisation of the Report
This monograph is organized into five Chapters.  Chapter 1 gives an introduction which
includes the background to the census, the 2002 census processes, data quality and the
organization of this report.  Chapter 2 presents th e household composition. Chapter 3
covers religious and ethnic composition while Chapter  4 covers marriage.  Chapter 5
presents the policy implications.

